    {
      "id": "file:src/threat_report_agent/analysis_task_orchestration.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "analysis_task_orchestration.py",
      "filePath": "src/threat_report_agent/analysis_task_orchestration.py",
      "summary": "Analysis Task 的调查阶段编排层：定义 persist HOW skip 判定、调查循环路径选择（READY/BOUNDARY 优先于预算、预算优先于 DeepMiningPlanner），以及工作账本 OPEN/DEFERRED/tail 的饱和调查与受控模拟交错。首轮 analyze 经 run_analysis_task_investigation 进入，DSH workbench 经 continue_investigation_after_action 续跑；DeepMiningPlanner 仍是唯一的动作提出者，本模块不做第二个 planner。",
      "tags": [
        "orchestration",
        "investigation",
        "persist-how",
        "work-ledger",
        "编排"
      ],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "用 Protocol 声明阶段机不拥有的 I/O（工作账本、调查循环、静态后受控模拟仍留在 AnalysisService），并通过 seed_result / static_boundary / unique_thread / supporting_boundary 四个注入回调把副作用挡在模块之外，模块只做纯决策。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/threat_report_agent/evidence_index.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "evidence_index.py",
      "filePath": "src/threat_report_agent/evidence_index.py",
      "summary": "为不可变静态 Evidence 生成规范化且有界的检索键：只保存归一化后的 selector，不复制样本字符串或反编译文本，供检索器在加载 Evidence 值之前先拿到有界的候选证据 ID。",
      "tags": [
        "indexing",
        "evidence-search",
        "normalization",
        "bounded"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "所有键都经 canonical_selector 折叠大小写与空白；裸 Ghidra 地址被特意保留为单个 selector，避免把 14000c520 拆成 c520 造成误召回。"
    },
    {
